# nuclear-audit working ledgers
/.audit/

# bench campaign payloads (raw cells.jsonl, charts, media outputs,
# dumps) do not belong in git — the repo keeps only the summary layer:
# INDEX.md, per-campaign reports (*/*.md), and root receipt JSONs.
# One full payload snapshot is preserved on the bench-archive GitHub
# release; regenerate charts with scripts/bench_charts.py from cells.
# staging/ symlinks point at user-local models; cells-stderr/ is
# debugging-only; corpus.txt captures working-tree prose incl.
# machine paths.
bench-artifacts/**
!bench-artifacts/**/
!bench-artifacts/INDEX.md
!bench-artifacts/**/*.md
!bench-artifacts/*.json

# playwright-cli session scratch: console/page snapshots from local
# browser validation runs — debugging-only, regenerable on demand.
.playwright-cli/
*.egg-info/

# TypeScript SDK dev install (never shipped)
sdk/ts/node_modules/
